  "source": {
    "type": "Property",
    "value": "Real data: test piece Zx2 (process pmdao-tto-tt-S355-2) of 'Full dataset of several mechanical tests on an S355 steel sheet as reference data for digital representations', Bundesanstalt fuer Materialforschung und -pruefung (BAM), Zenodo https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6778336, CC-BY-4.0 (also mapped to PMDco in https://github.com/materialdigital/tensile-test-ontology). Classes and relations from PMD Core Ontology 3.1.2, CC-BY-4.0, Plattform MaterialDigital, https://w3id.org/pmd/co"
